  "ruleText": "Puc 1303.08 Interest. Refunds or payments ordered under Puc 1304.07 shall accrue simple annual interest at a rate equal to the prime rate.\n\nSource. #9614, eff 12-12-09; ss by #12574, eff 9-1-1; ss by #13498, eff 12-1-22 (formerly Puc 1304.08) (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Puc 1300)\n\nAPPENDIX A\n\nRule | Statute\n\nPuc 1300 | RSA 374:3; RSA 374:34-a\n\nPuc 1301.01 | RSA 374:3; RSA 374:34-a\n\nPuc 1301.02(a) | RSA 374:3; RSA 374:34-a\n\nPuc 1301.02(b) | RSA 362:7, I-III; RSA 374:34-a\n\nPuc 1301.02(c) | RSA 374:3; RSA 374:34-a\n\nPuc 1302- Puc 1303 | RSA 374:3; RSA 374:34-a",
